关系类型是`PUSHED`。

接下来，我将根据【规则：关系类型与节点类型约束】来判断`PUSHED`关系在`Document`到`Organization`之间的适用性。
规则中明确指出：`Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document -` PUSHED `-> Person/Organization/Event/Movement/Document`。
